Code pages are decoded by go-fast-core's charset package, which was this
library's internal/codepage, merged with the decoders of the other go-fast
libraries. The tables and their sources (the Unicode Consortium's mapping
files, Python's codecs, the WHATWG Encoding Standard) are listed in
go-fast-core's NOTICE.

No third-party code or data is included in this repository.
